cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolchain, please cite both the software (this Zenodo record) and the associated paper."
title: "suslifepath-paper0: collision-risk index toolchain and catalogue snapshot"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB toolchain reproducing the numerical results, figures and tables of the
  companion manuscript on a simplified engineering algorithm for collision risk
  assessment and classification of LEO satellites, from a May 2026 Celestrak
  General Perturbations catalogue snapshot. Version 2.1.0 adds the evaluation across
  the whole catalogue, the Sentinel-6 end-of-life options and the collision-avoidance
  sensitivity of the revision for Advances in Space Research.
